Taking $r = cJ(A^*) \sqrt{\log \left(\frac{Tn}{\delta}\right)}$, this clearly implies $\ensuremath{\mathbb{P}}\left(\ensuremath{\ensuremath{\mathcal{E}}_{1b}}\right) \ge 1-\delta$.

